Then, the Diffusion State Distance (DSD) between two vertices u and v, ∀u,v∈V is defined as: 
\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
